:: Residential Shady Person
<<effects>><<generate1>>

You approach the shady-looking <<person1>><<person>>, and <<his>> eyes meet yours.
<br><br>

"You look like a fun-loving <<lady>>," <<he>> asserts. "Would you be interested in this batch of cheap SWP pills?"
<br><br>

Your eyes betray your curiosity. "Dynapill Corp. was about to get rid of these in bulk, but I managed to swoop-in just in time to salvage them," <<he>> strikes a prideful pose, as if what <<he>> did was praise worthy. "Thanks to that, I can sell 'em at an unbeatable price in bulk."

The <<person>> gives off shady vibe as hell, and under normal circumstances you'd stir away from people like <<him>>. But knowing just how expensive these pills can be on the open market, you feel kinda tempted to indulge. Even if these aren't regular X-Change pills, but rather unregulated SWP ones.
<br><br>

"I can sell you a batch of 10 pills for <<printmoney 10000>>," <<he>> offers. "Think about it. There might be very expensive, long duration variants mixed in the batch." <<He>> grabs one pill from the batch, pinching it between two fingers, to present it to you in an attempt to seal the deal.
<br><br>

"It would be a real bargain," <<he>> concludes. "So, what do you say? Interested?"
<br><br>

<<if $money gte 10000>>
	<<link [[Buy a batch of 10 pills (£100)|Residential Shady Person Accept]]>>
		<<if $player.gender is "m">>
			<<set $sexStats.pills.pills["Suspicious Pink Pill"].owned += 10>>
		<<elseif $player.gender is "f">>
			<<set $sexStats.pills.pills["Suspicious Blue Pill"].owned += 10>>
		<<else>>
			<<set $sexStats.pills.pills["Suspicious Purple Pill"].owned += 10>>
		<</if>>
		<<set $sexStats.pills.boughtOnce to true>>
		<<set $money -= 10000>>
	<</link>>
<<else>>
	You don't have enough cash.
<</if>>
<br>
<<if $money gte 20000>>
	<<link [[Buy a batch of 20 pills (£200)|Residential Shady Person Accept]]>>
		<<if $player.gender is "m">>
			<<set $sexStats.pills.pills["Suspicious Pink Pill"].owned += 20>>
		<<elseif $player.gender is "f">>
			<<set $sexStats.pills.pills["Suspicious Blue Pill"].owned += 20>>
		<<else>>
			<<set $sexStats.pills.pills["Suspicious Purple Pill"].owned += 20>>
		<</if>>
		<<set $sexStats.pills.boughtOnce to true>>
		<<set $money -= 20000>>
	<</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $money gte 30000>>
	<<link [[Buy a batch of 30 pills (£300)|Residential Shady Person Accept]]>>
		<<if $player.gender is "m">>
			<<set $sexStats.pills.pills["Suspicious Pink Pill"].owned += 30>>
		<<elseif $player.gender is "f">>
			<<set $sexStats.pills.pills["Suspicious Blue Pill"].owned += 30>>
		<<else>>
			<<set $sexStats.pills.pills["Suspicious Purple Pill"].owned += 30>>
		<</if>>
		<<set $sexStats.pills.boughtOnce to true>>
		<<set $money -= 30000>>
	<</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Refuse|Residential Shady Person Refuse]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Residential Shady Person Accept
<<effects>>

"There we go," the <<person>> takes the cash, and with single motion hands you over a tiny box filled with pills. "Pleasure doing business with you," and <<he>> storms off.
<br><br>

<<endevent>>

<<link [[Leave|Residential Alleyways]]>><</link>>

:: Residential Shady Person Refuse
<<effects>>

You tell you're not interested in the offer, and turn to leave.
<br><br>

"Suit yourself," <<he>> shrugs. "This offer's killer. So you'll probably come back." And just as you're barely within earshot, you hear <<him>> whisper under <<his>> breath: "This town will make sure of it, you <<slut>>."
<br><br>

<<endevent>>
<<link [[Leave|Residential Alleyways]]>><</link>>

:: Park Shady Person
<<effects>><<generate1>>

You approach the shady-looking, coat-wearing, <<person1>><<person>>, and <<his>> eyes meet yours.
<br><br>

<<if $daily.boughtRemoverPillToday gte 3>>
    "Hey, I'm sorry," <<he>> stonewalls you before you even have a chance to say a word. "We've got other clients who have shown interest in our product. So in the interest of fairness, I can only sell you so many anti-pills each day."
    <br><br>

    "But please, <<sir>>. Do come back tomorrow if you want another fix," <<he>> smiles widely while rubbing <<his>> hands together.
    <br><br>

    <<link [[Leave|Park]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
    
<<else>>
    <<if playerIsXChanged()>>
        "Having some trouble? Perhaps just having some fun?," with a knowing smile, as if seeing right through you, <<he>> continues.  "Either way, I know the signs. You'll surely get some use out of these." 
    <<else>>
        "This town can be ruthless," <<he>> makes a transparently fake show of empathy, bowing <<his>> head as if remourseful. "You look like the type to be made into a victim," <<he>> asserts with a certainty that almost feels offensive when accompanied by those words. "But you know what? I've got the thing just for somebody like you."
    <</if>>
    <br><br>

    From <<his>> pocket <<he>> takes out a bunch of <span class="green">green-looking pills</span>. "These are anti-pills. Authentic Somatic Warp Pharmaceutical (SWP) anti-pills," you reach out with curiosity but <<he>> retreats. "Ah ah ah, not so fast. These get produced in very limited quantities, so they aren't that easy to obtain."
    <br><br>

    <<if !$weekly.shadyPitchDelivered>>
        "In case you're wondering what they do," a bit snotty-nosed, <<he>> goes into a practiced sales pitch. "SWP has been proudly researching into ways to decode the otherwordly magic that is X-Change Pharmaceutics' tech. And one such result of said research has been these little puppies," <<he>> stand proudly as if this was an direct achievement of <<his>>. "Anti-pills."
        <br><br>

        "Pills that target the markers left on the body by the action of regular pills, in order to follow them to the source and neutralise the agents that cause any specified undesirable effect." Your ears perk up once you hear this last part. "You'll no longer have to fear the distressing effects of a Dumb Bitch pill anymore as long as you have its corresponding anti-Dumb Bitch pill at hand."
        <br><br>

        "And all of this for the very low price of <<printmoney 50000>> each," you listen intently as <<he>> finalises <<his>> pitch. "But you gotta act now. My stock is limited, and me and my associates will only remain on this town until the end of the week. Decide a minute too late, and you won't even find us."
        <br><br>

        <<set $weekly.shadyPitchDelivered to 1>>
    <<else>>
        Extending <<his>> hand once again to entice you. "Anyway, let's cut to the chase," <<he>> begins. "As my colleague probably explained the other day. These are <<printmoney 50000>> each."
        <br><br>
    <</if>>

    "So, what do say you?" <<he>> asks. "Interested?"
    <br><br>

    <<if $money gte 50000>>
        <<if $xchange.removerPillCatalogue.length gt 0>>
            <<set _catalogue = []>>
            <<run $xchange.removerPillCatalogue.forEach(pill => _catalogue.pushUnique(pill))>>
            <<for _type range _catalogue>>
                <<run console.log(`SWP Anti-${_type} Pill`)>>
                <<capture _type>>
                    <<link [[`Buy an anti-${_type} pill (£500)`|Park Shady Person Accept]]>>
                        <<set $sexStats.pills.pills[`SWP Anti-${_type} Pill`].owned += 1>>
                        <<set $sexStats.pills.boughtOnce to true>>
                        <<set $money -= 50000>>
                        <<run $xchange.removerPillCatalogue.deleteAt($xchange.removerPillCatalogue.indexOf(_type))>>
                        <<set $daily.boughtRemoverPillToday to ($daily.boughtRemoverPillToday ?? 0) + 1>>
                    <</link>> 
                <</capture>>
                | In Stock: <span class="gold"><<= $xchange.removerPillCatalogue.countWith(pill => pill === _type)>></span>
                <br>
            <</for>>
        <<else>>
            <<He>> has run out of stock.
            <br>
        <</if>>
    <<else>>
        You don't have enough cash.
        <br>
    <</if>>
    <br>
    <<if $xchange.removerPillCatalogue.length gt 0>>
        <<link [[Refuse|Park Shady Person Refuse]]>><</link>>
    <<else>>
        <<link [[Leave|Park]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
    <</if>>
    <br>
<</if>>

:: Park Shady Person Accept
<<effects>>

You purchase the innocuous-looking pill.
<br><br>

"There we go," the <<person>> pockets the cash, and with a single fluid motion, hands you over a tiny padded box containing the pill. 
<br><br>

/* "Pleasure doing business with you," and <<he>> storms off.
<br><br> */

/* <<endevent>> */
<<link [[Next|Park Shady Person]]>><</link>>

:: Park Shady Person Refuse
<<effects>>

You tell you're not interested in the offer, and turn to leave.
<br><br>

"Suit yourself," <<he>> shrugs. 
<br><br>

"The risks of getting spiked in this town do seem pretty high. So you'll probably be back." Barely within earshot, you hear <<him>> mutter under <<his>> breath: <span class="red">"Guess we are not distributing enough pills into this town after all..."</span>
<br><br>

<<endevent>>
<<link [[Leave|Park]]>><</link>>

:: Industrial Shady Person
<<effects>><<generate1>>
<<set $temp to {}>>
<<if $daily.shadydealRate is undefined>>
	<<set $daily.shadydealRate to random(5, 10) * 100>>
<</if>>
<<set $temp.goingrate to $daily.shadydealRate>>
<<set $temp.cost24 to $temp.goingrate * 24>>
<<set $temp.cost72 to $temp.cost24 * 3>>
<<set $temp.cost168 to $temp.cost24 * 7>>

You approach the shady-looking <<person1>><<person>>, and <<his>> eyes meet yours.
<br><br>

"You look like a fun-loving <<lady>>," <<he>> asserts. "Would you be interested in something a little special?"
<br><br>

Your eyes betray your curiosity. "I just happen to have a lucky batch of <span class="lewd"><i>pockethole pills</i></span> in my pocket," <<he>> says, waggling a single pill between two fingers. "Hard to get, strong stuff, and worth every penny."

The <<person>> gives off shady vibe as hell, and under normal circumstances you'd stir away from people like <<him>>. But knowing how costly and hard to find some pills can be, you can't help but hesitate.
<br><br>

Seeing as you aren't reeling away already, the <<person>> continues: "You'd just need to pop one of these right here and now. And I'll take your picture so I can keep track of who I sold this pill to." You feel a hint of hesitation raise up upon the mention of your picture being taken under such a shady deal.
<br><br>

"The current going rate for this stuff is <<printmoney $temp.goingrate>> per hour of duration. So if you take the 24-hour variant, it'll cost you <<printmoney $temp.cost24>>," <<he>> concludes. "So, what do you say? Interested?"
<br><br>

<<if $money gte $temp.cost24>>
	<<link [[Buy the 24-hour variant|Industrial Shady Person Accept]]>><<set $temp.duration to 1>><</link>> <span class="gold">(<<printmoney $temp.cost24>>)</span>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">You don't have enough cash for the 24-hour variant (<<printmoney $temp.cost24>>).</span>
<</if>>
<br>
<<if $money gte $temp.cost72>>
	<<link [[Buy the 3-days variant|Industrial Shady Person Accept]]>><<set $temp.duration to 3>><</link>> <span class="gold">(<<printmoney $temp.cost72>>)</span>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">You don't have enough cash for the 3-days variant (<<printmoney $temp.cost72>>).</span>
<</if>>
<br>
<<if $money gte $temp.cost168>>
	<<link [[Buy the 7-days variant|Industrial Shady Person Accept]]>><<set $temp.duration to 7>><</link>> <span class="gold">(<<printmoney $temp.cost168>>)</span>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">You don't have enough cash for the 7-days variant (<<printmoney $temp.cost168>>).</span>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[Refuse|Industrial Shady Person Refuse]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Industrial Shady Person Accept
<<effects>>
<<set $temp.cost to $temp.duration * $daily.shadydeal>>

<<if $money lt $temp.cost>>
	You reach for your money, but come up short.
	<br><br>

	"Come back when you can actually afford it," <<he>> says with a sneer.
	<br><br>

	<<endevent>><<unset $temp>>
	<<link [[Leave|Industrial Alleyways]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $money -= $temp.cost>>

	You hand over the cash and pop the pill as instructed.

	<<if playerIsXChanged()>>
	    <<xchange-addeffect "portal" $temp.duration>>

	    As you do, a feeling of mild warmth raises up from your chest, and then a breeze feeling assaults your crotch.
	<<elseif $player.gender is "m">>
	    <<xchange-pink $temp.duration "portal">><<xchange-seen 5>>

	    As you do, your body shifts and turns until the distintive form. And in addition to that, a now permanent breezy feeling assaults your crotch, making you blush slightly.
	<<else>>
	    <<xchange-blue $temp.duration "portal">><<xchange-seen 5>>

	    As you do, your body shifts and turns until the distintive form. And in addition to that, a now permanent breezy feeling assaults your crotch, making you blush slightly.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	"There we go," the <<person>> takes your cash, snaps a quick picture, and pockets both before giving you a satisfied smile. "Pleasure doing business with you," and <<he>> storms off.
	<br><br>

	<<endevent>><<unset $temp>>
	<<link [[Leave|Industrial Alleyways]]>><</link>>
<</if>>


:: Industrial Shady Person Refuse
<<effects>>

You tell you're not interested in the offer, and turn to leave.
<br><br>
"Suit yourself," <<he>> shrugs. "These pills don't stay in stock for long. You'll probably come back." 
<br><br>
And just as you're barely within earshot, you hear <<him>> whisper under <<his>> breath: "<span class="lewd">And if not for the convenience... you'll probably do it for the pleasure, you <<slut>></span>."
<br><br>

<<endevent>>
<<link [[Leave|Industrial Alleyways]]>><</link>>
